Signature rewards you grant as friendship grows: camera-strap (neutral), photo-vest (warm), vespa (close)
Example valid quest spec: {"giverNpcId":"alex","steps":[{"type":"GO_TO","locationId":"cathedral"}],"scope":"solo","title":"Light across the square","description":"Visit the cathedral square and find the afternoon light."}",
